      "created_at": "2013-04-21T02:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Does that mean that even though the only Sector we've seen so far seems to be just a section of space in which we have to imagine there are stations at which to get Station cards, others will be moons, planets, bases, space stations, etc.? &nbsp;Or will they always just be nebulous spots in space and it's up to us to imagine the details of where we are landing our ships?</p><p>What I mean is, will the Sectors always be the Hoth Sector, or will some be the planet Hoth, or even Echo Base itself?</p>",
